1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:03,280
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) Ms. Howard assigns a project.

2
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:07,039
She wants the students to work in groups.

3
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:10,400
Adam works with Joe and Bill.

4
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:12,540
Adam is smart.

5
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:14,860
Joe draws well.

6
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:17,460
Bill is cooperative.

7
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,260
They make a good group.

8
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:22,920
They turn in their project.

9
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,740
Ms. Howard likes it.

10
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:28,620
She gives them a high grade.

11
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:32,940
Adam, Joe, and Bill are joyful.
